  "new years resolution",
  "to welcome the new year, we offer this small chant in glonglish:",
  "> r\u0361rombo dombo di di dai",
  "> r\u0361rom bobo dombo di di dombo!",
  "it means: i am here, vibrating with playful presence, beyond all explanation.",
